; Differential fuzzer (dev-only, package pcre2-dev): drives a grammar-based
; pattern/subject/option generator through BOTH the pure OCaml engine
; (pcre2.engine: Pcre2_engine.Engine) and the C oracle
; (pcre2-dev.test-driver: Pcre2_test_driver.Test_driver) and reports every
; divergence, auto-minimized into a pcre2test-format repro under
; fuzz/corpus/regressions/. Stdlib only otherwise.

(executable
 (name fuzz_diff)
 (public_name pcre2-fuzz-diff)
 (package pcre2-dev)
 (modules fuzz_diff)
 (libraries pcre2.engine pcre2-dev.test-driver))
